    "summary": "Man&#039;s wrapper; composed of eighteen narrow strips, hand sewn together. Alternating warp- and weft-faced strips. Warp strips in indigo-dyed cotton with central white cotton stripe and  weft-faced bands in red-dyed cotton edged with white cotton. Weft-faced strips in red-dyed cotton with narrow stripes in indigo- and yellow-dyed cotton and weft-faced bands in white, yellow- and indigo-dyed cotton. Weft-faced block-coloured bands align across the cloth. Hand sewn hems at both ends.",
